Third-party material
--------------------

The chess pieces on the live-board pages (`OpenResultsWeb.LiveBoardsComponents`,
`piece_sprite/1`) are this project's own drawings: plain geometric silhouettes
made for it, released under the same licence as the rest of the code. They are
not taken from, traced from or modelled on any other piece set, and no
third-party piece artwork is shipped or loaded from anywhere.

The three games in `priv/live_sim` are public-domain games played before 1900
and in 1910 (the moves of a game are not protected), transcribed here for the
development simulator.

The move generator in `lib/openresults/chess.ex` is written for this project
and verified against the published perft node counts of the standard test
positions.
